foreign  greatness runs in this family the famous  World Cup trophy was made in this  Workshop in Italy in 1971 by Sylvia  gotzanica  the artist beat more than 50 other  designers to be chosen to replace FIFA's  original trophy  gutz amiga's son says the current world  cup trophy design is special because it  can be photographed from all angles  giving a full world view he was also  thinking how the winner have to use it  in front of the camera and so it was  starting a way that they can really keep  in the hand and rise like a cup in a  ceremony  the cup was first awarded to what was  then West Germany in 1974. It's Made of  18 karat gold with bands of malachite on  its base depicting two humans holding up  the Earth it's nearly 37 centimeters  tall and weighs more than six kilograms  I'm trembling with anticipation to see  the trophy because I'm so excited to  work here that I can't wait to see it on  television and feel that emotion that my  colleagues have felt over the years when  they produce the World Cup  gutzaniga who died in 2016 originally  worked as a sculptor under business  owner Giorgio bortoni his firm still  holds the rights to making the iconic  Trophy and others including the UEFA  Champions League and the African Cup of  Nations  today its CEO is the granddaughter of  the man who hired gazanika many years  ago when we you love something so much  and you worked so hard to receive it you  just love it after the final game is won  the trophy comes back to Italy for a  little cosmetic touch-up before being  returned to FIFA's headquarters in  Switzerland  the winning country gets a gold-plated  replica to keep while Italy did not  qualify for the World Cup the country  will still be represented at the finals  in Qatar just in a different way they're  very emotional about the final and uh  I guess we are the only Italians that we  will be like uh crying during the final  uh match because we will know we'll be  on the podium  a family tradition elevated to Global  icon status  Leah Harding Al Jazeera

